"OFF by default. Agents can always read metrics and run dry-run previews. With this on, an agent can run a real `mo clean` / `optimize` / `uninstall` — but ONLY when it also passes an explicit confirm flag, so a deletion is never one stray sentence away. Turn it off and agents are read-only again. Data stays on this Mac." = "默认关闭。智能体始终可以读取指标并运行试运行预览。开启后，智能体可以真正执行 `mo clean` / `optimize` / `uninstall` — 但仅当它同时传入明确的确认标志时，因此删除绝不会因一句话而发生。关闭后智能体恢复只读。数据始终留在这台 Mac 上。";
"Runs against a local Ollama model — nothing leaves this Mac. Start it with `ollama run <model>`." = "在本地 Ollama 模型上运行 — 不会离开这台 Mac。用 `ollama run <model>` 启动。";
"Any OpenAI-compatible server. For LM Studio: load a model, open Developer ▸ Start Server, and leave the key blank — the default URL is already LM Studio's. A hosted endpoint (e.g. OpenAI) needs a key and sends the metrics summary off-device (never file contents)." = "任何兼容 OpenAI 的服务器。LM Studio：加载模型，打开 Developer ▸ Start Server，密钥留空 — 默认 URL 已是 LM Studio 的。托管端点（如 OpenAI）需要密钥，并会把指标摘要发送到设备外（绝不发送文件内容）。";
"Sparkle checks Burrow's signed update feed after startup settles and about once a day. It asks before downloading or installing anything." = "Sparkle 会在启动稳定后及大约每天一次检查 Burrow 的签名更新源。下载或安装前都会先询问。";
