"Share anonymous usage & diagnostics" = "分享匿名使用情况和诊断数据";
"Sends anonymous product analytics (PostHog) and crash reports (Sentry): a random install id (not tied to you or your hardware), the app + macOS version, CPU type, and which features you use — with sizes and counts bucketed. Never file names, contents, paths, or your metrics. It helps gauge retention and catch crashes. On by default; turn it off and both stop. Full list in TELEMETRY.md." = "发送匿名产品分析（PostHog）和崩溃报告（Sentry）：一个随机安装 ID（与你本人和硬件无关）、应用与 macOS 版本、CPU 类型，以及你使用了哪些功能 — 大小和数量都按区间归档。绝不包含文件名、文件内容、路径或你的指标数据。它用于了解留存并发现崩溃。默认开启；关闭后两者都会停止。完整列表见 TELEMETRY.md。";
"Sends anonymous product analytics (PostHog) plus crash, hang, startup, update, and sampled performance diagnostics (Sentry): random install IDs, app and exact macOS build, CPU type, screens and features used, and fixed-name diagnostic milestones. Never screenshots, screen recordings, your file names, contents, user paths, URLs, or metrics. On by default; turn it off and both stop. Full list in TELEMETRY.md." = "发送匿名产品分析（PostHog），以及崩溃、卡顿、启动、更新和抽样性能诊断（Sentry）：包括随机安装 ID、应用与准确的 macOS 构建版本、CPU 类型、使用的页面和功能，以及固定名称的诊断节点。绝不包含截图、屏幕录像、你的文件名、文件内容、用户路径、URL 或指标数据。默认开启；关闭后两者都会停止。完整列表见 TELEMETRY.md。";
"Burrow started in compatibility mode" = "Burrow 已以兼容模式启动";
