/* ===== Uninstall pre-flight: identity of the resolved app ===== */
"“%@” isn't an identifier that names one app — it resolves to whichever app the engine happens to match first, so nothing was removed. Use the app's bundle id or its exact name." = "“%@”不是能指明某一个应用的标识符 —— 它会匹配到引擎恰好最先命中的那个应用，因此没有删除任何内容。请使用该应用的 Bundle ID 或它的准确名称。";
"The engine didn't say which application “%@” resolves to, so Burrow can't confirm it's the right one and nothing was removed." = "引擎没有说明“%@”会解析到哪个应用，Burrow 无法确认它是否正确，因此没有删除任何内容。";
"The engine resolved %@ twice, so the run wouldn't act on the set it reported." = "引擎把 %@ 解析了两次，这次运行不会正好作用于它所报告的集合。";
"“%1$@” isn't %2$@'s name or bundle id — the engine matched it by substring, so it may not be the app you meant. Nothing was removed; ask for it by name: %3$@." = "“%1$@”既不是 %2$@ 的名称也不是它的 Bundle ID —— 引擎是按子串匹配到它的，未必是你想要的应用。没有删除任何内容；请按名称指明：%3$@。";
"The engine resolved an argument Burrow didn't send (“%@”), so nothing was removed." = "引擎解析出了一个 Burrow 并未发送的参数（“%@”），因此没有删除任何内容。";
